1
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:08,490
Are you Lady Elianna Bernstein?

2
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:20,120
I didn't expect the fiancée of the prince of Sauslind
to look like a porcelain doll.

3
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:22,630
I'm sorry, I don't believe I...

4
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,260
Irvin Orlanza.

5
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:29,090
I am here under the invitation of Lady Kreis.

6
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:33,300
<i>Right… His name came up this afternoon.</i>

7
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:36,390
Is there something you need from me?

8
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:41,020
No. You're just not what I expected.

9
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:49,650
The Count said something so harsh to you
that you were close to tears.

10
00:00:50,410 --> 00:00:54,030
To come across the "Brain of Sauslind"
being reduced to the verge of tears...

11
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:58,290
<i>Why does he know my family's alias?</i>

12
00:01:00,540 --> 00:01:02,580
This is quite the letdown.

13
00:01:06,710 --> 00:01:13,680
Miseral Dukedom

14
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:13,680
It’s been confirmed that there are bandits
from other countries amassing in the Eidel Domain.

15
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:18,180
In addition to that, the guest of honor
has privately entered the country.

16
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:22,060
Understood. Continue your surveillance.

17
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:22,810
Yes, Your Highness.

18
00:01:23,940 --> 00:01:25,690
<i>Interesting.</i>

19
00:01:25,690 --> 00:01:27,980
<i>It may have something to do with Eli…</i>

20
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:33,070
Act as Elianna's Shadow, immediately.

21
00:01:34,370 --> 00:01:35,330
As you wish.

